# Pachelbel -- Canon in D. Public domain.
# Arranged: the eight-bar ground bass exactly as written, the harpsichord-style
# chord figuration above it, and the first violin's entry in whole notes. The
# later divisions are not transcribed here.
#
# THIS IS THE FILE TO READ IF YOU WANT TO SEE WHAT @section AND @order BUY.
# The ground is eight bars. Written out four times it would be 32 bars of
# duplicated text that can drift apart under editing. Written once and ordered
# `ground ground+melody ...`, one edit to the bass changes every repeat, and
# the diff shows one line.

@track canon-in-d
  name   CANON IN D
  bpm    64
  beats  16
  era    16bit
  tags   classical pachelbel public-domain

@section ground
@voice bass inst=fm-bass mix=0.16
  d2  .   .   .   .   .   .   .   d2  .   .   .   a2  .   .   .
