# The canon: the same line, one statement behind. This is the piece's whole
# idea, and in this format it is literally the same eight lines pasted into a
# second voice -- which is the clearest possible demonstration that a score is
# text you can manipulate.
@voice violin2 inst=strings mix=0.11 pan=0.28
  -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -   -
  f#5 .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .   .
